 in line at closing, you can vote."], ["How do you research candidates?","Official voter guides, debates, nonpartisan sites like vote411.org."], ["What is a sample ballot?","A preview of your exact ballot before Election Day."], ["What is voter intimidation?","Illegal threats or coercion at polls \u2014 report it."], ["What if your name is missing from the rolls?","Ask for a provisional ballot; check registration status early."], ["Do you have to vote the whole ballot?","No \u2014 blank races are fine; your counted votes still count."], ["What is ranked-choice voting?","Ranking candidates; instant runoffs until someone has a majority."], ["How are votes counted securely?","Bipartisan observers, paper trails, audits, and certification."], ["When are results final?","After counting and certification \u2014 days to weeks."]];
function ask(n){var out=[],seen={};n=Math.min(n,ITEMS.length);for(var k=0;k<n;k++){var it=ITEMS[(Math.random()*ITEMS.length)|0];out.push("Q"+(k+1)+": "+it[0]+"\nA"+(k+1)+": "+it[1]);}return out.join("\n\n");}
function lookup(q){q=String(q).toLowerCase();var h=[];for(var i=0;i<ITEMS.length;i++){if((ITEMS[i][0]+" "+ITEMS[i][1]).toLowerCase().indexOf(q)>=0)h.push(ITEMS[i][0]+" — "+ITEMS[i][1]);}return h.length?h.join("\n"):"no match for "+q;}
console.log("== drill ==");console.log(ask(5));

